    },
    "pages": [
        {
            "id": "greeting",
            "speaker": "unknown",
            "lines": [
                "It was good of you to come."
            ],
            "input": {
                "type": "option",
                "vertical": false,
                "options": [
                    {
                        "text": "Next",
                        "value": "next",
                        "action": [
                            "q.dialogue.set_page('page2');"
                        ]
                    }
                ]
            }
        },
        {
            "id": "page2",
            "speaker": "unknown",
            "lines": [
                "Yes... I need 30 seconds of your time. Or--three minutes only. Thirty minutes, maybe."
            ],
            "input": {
                "type": "option",
                "vertical": false,
                "options": [
                    {
                        "text": "Next",
                        "value": "next",
                        "action": "q.dialogue.set_page('page3');"
                    }
                ]
            }
        },
        {
            "id": "page3",
            "speaker": "unknown",
            "lines": [
                {
                    "type": "expression",
                    "expression": "'First, you must know that I have taken the liberty of investigating you, ' + q.player.username + '.';"
                }
            ],
            "input": {
                "type": "option",
                "vertical": false,
                "options": [
                    {
                        "text": "Next",
                        "value": "next",
                        "action": "q.dialogue.set_page('page4');"
                    }
                ]
            }
        },
        {
            "id": "page4",
            "speaker": "unknown",
            "lines": [
                "For example, I can say that you're the newest Champion of the Kalos region."
            ],
            "input": {
                "type": "option",
                "vertical": false,
                "options": [
                    {
                        "text": "Next",
                        "value": "next",
                        "action": "q.dialogue.set_page('page5');"
                    }
                ]
            }
        },
        {
            "id": "page5",
            "speaker": "unknown",
            "lines": [
                "Also, I can say that you were the one to save our world from the group known as Team Flare. Good. Very good."
            ],
            "input": {
                "type": "option",
                "vertical": false,
                "options": [
                    {
                        "text": "Next",
                        "value": "next",
                        "action": [
                            "q.run_command('execute as ' + q.player.username + ' run function kalos:triggers/stopsound');",
                            "q.run_command('execute as ' + q.player.username + ' run playsound lookerstheme record @s[tag=!RadioOff] ~ ~ ~ 1 1 1');",
                            "q.run_command('execute as ' + q.player.username + ' run scoreboard players set @s[tag=!RadioOff] MusicCooldown 91');",
                            "q.dialogue.set_page('page6');"
                    ]
                    }
                ]
            }
        },
        {
            "id": "page6",
            "speaker": "unknown",
            "lines": [
                "I have delayed in giving my introduction. My code name is--no! Hah!"
            ],
            "input": {
                "type": "option",
                "vertical": false,
                "options": [
                    {
                        "text": "Next",
                        "value": "next",
                        "action": "q.dialogue.set_page('page7');"
                    }
                ]
            }
        },
        {
            "id": "page7",
            "speaker": "npc",
            "lines": [
                "I mean to say, my name is Looker."
            ],
            "input": {
                "type": "option",
                "vertical": false,
                "options": [
                    {
                        "text": "Next",
                        "value": "next",
                        "action": "q.dialogue.set_page('page8');"
                    }
                ]
            }
        },
        {
            "id": "page8",
            "speaker": "npc",
            "lines": [
                "I'm no more than a grim, middle-aged man who works in this town as a detective."
            ],
            "input": {
                "type": "option",
                "vertical": false,
                "options": [
                    {
                        "text": "Next",
                        "value": "next",
                        "action": "q.dialogue.set_page('page9');"
                    }
                ]
            }
        },
        {
            "id": "page9",
            "speaker": "npc",
            "lines": [
                {
                    "type": "expression",
                    "expression": "'And now, let us approach the real subject, ' + q.player.username + ', my friend.';"
                }
            ],
            "input": {
                "type": "option",
                "vertical": false,
                "options": [
                    {
                        "text": "Next",
                        "value": "next",
                        "action": "q.dialogue.set_page('page10');"
                    }
                ]
            }
        },
        {
            "id": "page10",
            "speaker": "npc",
            "lines": [
                "I investigated you, yes. I called you here today, yes."
            ],
            "input": {
                "type": "option",
                "vertical": false,
                "options": [
                    {
                        "text": "Next",
                        "value": "next",
                        "action": "q.dialogue.set_page('page11');"
                    }
                ]
            }
        },
        {
            "id": "page11",
            "speaker": "npc",
            "lines": [
                "The reasons for these actions? Listen well..."
            ],
            "input": {
                "type": "option",
                "vertical": false,
                "options": [
                    {
                        "text": "Next",
                        "value": "next",
                        "action": "q.dialogue.set_page('page12');"
                    }
                ]
            }
        },
        {
            "id": "page12",
            "speaker": "npc",
            "lines": [
                "Lumiose City... It is a tourist destination whose name is known all over the world."
            ],
            "input": {
                "type": "option",
                "vertical": false,
                "options": [
                    {
                        "text": "Next",
                        "value": "next",
                        "action": "q.dialogue.set_page('page13');"
                    }
                ]
            }
        },
        {
            "id": "page13",
            "speaker": "npc",
            "lines": [
                "Many kinds of people live here, and even more come to visit and enjoy the atmosphere."
            ],
            "input": {
                "type": "option",
                "vertical": false,
                "options": [
                    {
                        "text": "Next",
                        "value": "next",
                        "action": "q.dialogue.set_page('page14');"
                    }
                ]
            }
        },
        {
            "id": "page14",
            "speaker": "npc",
            "lines": [
                "The fact is, wherever there are so many people in one place, trouble is never far behind."
            ],
            "input": {
                "type": "option",
                "vertical": false,
                "options": [
                    {
                        "text": "Next",
                        "value": "next",
                        "action": "q.dialogue.set_page('page15');"
                    }
                ]
            }
        },
        {
            "id": "page15",
            "speaker": "npc",
            "lines": [
                "Trouble beckons me. Yes. Trouble troubles me."
            ],
            "input": {
                "type": "option",
                "vertical": false,
                "options": [
                    {
                        "text": "Next",
                        "value": "next",
                        "action": "q.dialogue.set_page('page16');"
                    }
                ]
            }
        },
        {
            "id": "page16",
            "speaker": "npc",
            "lines": [
                "And so I arrive, and so I open this agency."
            ],
            "input": {
                "type": "option",
                "vertical": false,
                "options": [
                    {
                        "text": "Next",
                        "value": "next",
                        "action": "q.dialogue.set_page('page17');"
                    }
                ]
            }
        },
        {
            "id": "page17",
            "speaker": "npc",
            "lines": [
                "Being a detective and doing such work requires a person with a hard-boiled heart."
            ],
            "input": {
                "type": "option",
                "vertical": false,
                "options": [
                    {
                        "text": "Next",
                        "value": "next",
                        "action": "q.dialogue.set_page('page18');"
                    }
                ]
            }
        },
        {
            "id": "page18",
            "speaker": "npc",
            "lines": [
                "But even a heart that embraces the loneliness can sometimes stumble, falter, doubt."
            ],
            "input": {
                "type": "option",
                "vertical": false,
                "options": [
                    {
                        "text": "Next",
                        "value": "next",
                        "action": "q.dialogue.set_page('page19');"
                    }
                ]
            }
        },
        {
            "id": "page19",
            "speaker": "npc",
            "lines": [
                "And that's where you come in, kid. I want you to be my assistant. No, more than that!"
            ],
            "input": {
                "type": "option",
                "vertical": false,
                "options": [
                    {
                        "text": "Next",
                        "value": "next",
                        "action": "q.dialogue.set_page('page20');"
                    }
                ]
            }
        },
        {
            "id": "page20",
            "speaker": "npc",
            "lines": [
                "I want you to be my partner."
            ],
            "input": {
                "type": "option",
                "vertical": false,
                "options": [
                    {
                        "text": "Next",
                        "value": "next",
                        "action": "q.dialogue.set_page('page21');"
                    }
                ]
            }
        },
        {
            "id": "page21",
            "speaker": "npc",
            "lines": [
                "If a Champion like you and an iron-jawed detective like me join forces, I promise we can bring peace to Lumiose City!"
            ],
            "input": {
                "type": "option",
                "vertical": false,
                "options": [
                    {
                        "text": "Next",
                        "value": "next",
                        "action": "q.dialogue.set_page('page22');"
                    }
                ]
            }
        },
        {
            "id": "page22",
            "speaker": "npc",
            "lines": [
                {
                    "type": "expression",
                    "expression": "'What does your heart say, ' + q.player.username + '? Will you partner with me and fight crime?';"
                }
            ],
            "input": {
                "type": "option",
                "vertical": false,
                "options": [
                    {
                        "text": "Yes",
                        "value": "yes",
                        "action": "q.dialogue.set_page('page23');"
                    },
                    {
                        "text": "No",
                        "value": "no",
                        "action": "q.dialogue.set_page('decline1');"
                    }
                ]
            }
        },
        {
            "id": "page23",
            "speaker": "npc",
            "lines": [
                "For your brave answer, I thank you. Lumiose City will regain its tranquillity!"
            ],
            "input": {
                "type": "option",
                "vertical": false,
                "options": [
                    {
                        "text": "Next",
                        "value": "next",
                        "action": "q.dialogue.set_page('page24');"
                    }
                ]
            }
        },
        {
            "id": "page24",
            "speaker": "npc",
            "lines": [
                "Well, I wish it could be that easy."
            ],
            "input": {
                "type": "option",
                "vertical": false,
                "options": [
                    {
                        "text": "Next",
                        "value": "next",
                        "action": "q.dialogue.set_page('page25');"
                    }
                ]
            }
        },
        {
            "id": "page25",
            "speaker": "npc",
            "lines": [
                "Because even though you are Champion, you're still a rookie when it comes to detective work."
            ],
            "input": {
                "type": "option",
                "vertical": false,
                "options": [
                    {
                        "text": "Next",
                        "value": "next",
                        "action": "q.dialogue.set_page('page26');"
                    }
                ]
            }
        },
        {
            "id": "page26",
            "speaker": "npc",
            "lines": [
                "And that's why I must ask you to enroll in my class in detective and espionage skills:"
            ],
            "input": {
                "type": "option",
                "vertical": false,
                "options": [
                    {
                        "text": "Next",
                        "value": "next",
                        "action": "q.dialogue.set_page('page27');"
                    }
                ]
            }
        },
        {
            "id": "page27",
            "speaker": "npc",
            "lines": [
                "\u201cThe Looker Method: Yes, even YOU can become a detective in five easy steps!\u201d"
            ],
            "input": {
                "type": "option",
                "vertical": false,
                "options": [
                    {
                        "text": "Next",
                        "value": "next",
                        "action": "q.dialogue.set_page('page28');"
                    }
                ]
            }
        },
        {
            "id": "page28",
            "speaker": "npc",
            "lines": [
                "Allow me to explain what you will be doing."
            ],
            "input": {
                "type": "option",
                "vertical": false,
                "options": [
                    {
                        "text": "Next",
                        "value": "next",
                        "action": "q.dialogue.set_page('page29');"
                    }
                ]
            }
        },
        {
            "id": "page29",
            "speaker": "npc",
            "lines": [
                "You will need to find five Looker Tickets that have been sprinkled about Lumiose City, and then bring them back to me!"
            ],
            "input": {
                "type": "option",
                "vertical": false,
                "options": [
                    {
                        "text": "Next",
                        "value": "next",
                        "action": "q.dialogue.set_page('page30');"
                    }
                ]
            }
        },
        {
            "id": "page30",
            "speaker": "npc",
            "lines": [
                "There's nothing more to it! Simple as can be!"
            ],
            "input": {
                "type": "option",
                "vertical": false,
                "options": [
                    {
                        "text": "Next",
                        "value": "next",
                        "action": "q.dialogue.set_page('page31');"
                    }
                ]
            }
        },
        {
            "id": "page31",
            "speaker": "npc",
            "lines": [
                "The Looker Tickets will be sure to catch your eye with their glitter and sparkles."
            ],
            "input": {
                "type": "option",
                "vertical": false,
                "options": [
                    {
                        "text": "Next",
                        "value": "next",
                        "action": "q.dialogue.set_page('page32');"
                    }
                ]
            }
        },
        {
            "id": "page32",
            "speaker": "npc",
            "lines": [
                "I want you to succeed, so I have left some hints in my notebook about where to find the tickets!"
            ],
            "input": {
                "type": "option",
                "vertical": false,
                "options": [
                    {
                        "text": "Next",
                        "value": "next",
                        "action": "q.dialogue.set_page('page33');"
                    }
                ]
            }
        },
        {
            "id": "page33",
            "speaker": "npc",
            "lines": [
                "Just give it a click any time to read it! It's on the table on my desk."
            ],
            "input": {
                "type": "option",
                "vertical": false,
                "options": [
                    {
                        "text": "Close",
                        "value": "close",
                        "action": [
                            "q.run_command('tag ' + q.player.username + ' remove InDialogue');",
                            "q.run_command('tag ' + q.player.username + ' add Dialogue173');",
                            "q.dialogue.close();"
                        ]
                    }
                ]
            }
        },


        {
            "id": "decline1",
            "speaker": "npc",
            "lines": [
                {
                    "type": "expression",
                    "expression": "'No? ' + q.player.username + ', my friend! This answer surprises me.';"
                }
            ],
            "input": {
                "type": "option",
                "vertical": false,
                "options": [
                    {
                        "text": "Next",
                        "value": "next",
                        "action": "q.dialogue.set_page('decline2');"
                    }
                ]
            }
        },
        {
            "id": "decline2",
            "speaker": "npc",
            "lines": [
                "It is not what I expected. I need a partner like you in order to protect the peace of this city."
            ],
            "input": {
                "type": "option",
                "vertical": false,
                "options": [
                    {
                        "text": "Next",
                        "value": "next",
                        "action": "q.dialogue.set_page('decline3');"
                    }
                ]
            }
        },
        {
            "id": "decline3",
            "speaker": "npc",
            "lines": [
                {
                    "type": "expression",
                    "expression": "'Reconsider, ' + q.player.username + '. The city needs you. I need you. Will you not be my partner?';"
                }
            ],
            "input": {
                "type": "option",
                "vertical": false,
                "options": [
                    {
                        "text": "Yes",
                        "value": "yes",
                        "action": "q.dialogue.set_page('page23');"
                    },
                    {
                        "text": "No",
                        "value": "no",
                        "action": "q.dialogue.set_page('decline1');"
                    }
                ]
            }
        }
    ]
